note: The Draw library: make a sprite, then move it around.
note: Sprites start in the centre of the drawing at (0, 0).
note: Pixel amounts are always written as text, like "40".

define 'hero' as drawing sprite
'hero' move right "60"
'hero' move down "30"
'hero' move left "20"
'hero' move up "10"

say "The hero sprite has moved - watch the drawing below!"
